  "historyNote": "#8444, eff 10-06-05 amd by #9652, eff 2-3-10; paras. (a)-(g) EXPIRED: 10-6-13; ss by #10808, eff 4-2-15; ss by #10974, eff 11-13-15, EXPIRED: 11-13-25 New. #14271, INTERIM, eff 6-16-25, EXPIRES: 12-14-25; ss by #14591, eff 7-17-26, EXPIRES: 7-17-36",
